                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Evaluated Shifts</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - successful shifts</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>No- Clock Out Shifts (%)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - number of shifts that have time between clock-in and clock-out is longer than 15h / number of shifts</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Hours Worked</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - hours worked by the picker. Calculated by the time dif between the picker clock-in and clock-out</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10' italic='true'>In cases where shift is longer than 15h (when picker forgets to clock out) we calculate the working hours by adding the scheduled shift duration to the clock in time of the picker.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Scheduled Hours</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - hours scheduled for the particular shift</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Attendance (%) </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>- hours worked / hours scheduled - can be higher than 100% in cases when due to being late for the shift or doing overtime the picker is working during hours he was not scheduled to work.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Order UTR</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - Number of orders picked / Hours Worked</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Item UTR</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - Number of items picked / Hours Worked </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Picker Est. CPO</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - Picker Labor Cost / Number of Orders</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
