                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - the sum of the Picking Time and Packing Time</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Occupancy (%)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - Hours Worked Picking, Receiving, and Counting / Hours Worked</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Picking Occupancy</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - Hours Worked Picking / Hours Worked</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Receiving Occupancy</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - Hours Worked Receiving / Hours Worked</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Counting Occupancy </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>- Hours Worked Counting / Hours Worked</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Hours Worked Receiving</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - the sum of the Receiving Time (for POs) [m] / 60</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Store Transfer Related:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Store Transfers</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - How many ST were originated there</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Store Transfer SKUs</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - Total ST SKU count at origin warehouse</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Avg. SKUs/ST</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - Avg SKU count per ST at origin warehouse</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Avg. Items/SKU/ST</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - Avg SKU Quantity per SKU per ST at origin warehouse</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Avg. ST Time (m)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - Avg Time taken per ST at destination warehouse </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>ST Time (m) / SKU</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - Avg ST Time taken per SKU at destination warehouse </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Put-away Related:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Put-away time/ SKU (s)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - Average put-away time per SKU in seconds</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Put-away time Corr. </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>- If for a batch put-away time/ SKU is more then 10 minutes it&apos;s considered as 10 minutes</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Put-away time Corr./ SKU (s) </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>- Average put-away time corr. per SKU in seconds</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Put-away time Corr./ Batch (m) </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>- Average put-away time corr. per out-away batch in minutes</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Put-away time Corr./ Unit (s) </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>- Average put-away time corr. per unit in seconds</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>% Batches with Putaway time/SKU &gt;10mins</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - % of put-away batches where put-away time / SKU is greated than 10 minutes</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Putaway Batch Count</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - Total number of put-away batched</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>SKU Put-away per Batch</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - Number of SKU per batch</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>Putaway Units per Batch</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'> - Total Quantity of SKUs per batch</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#555555' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
