                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>!!!!Dear users, we are happy to offer you a new updated comprehensive report for Rooster Complience. !!!!</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#4996b2' fontsize='10' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/#/site/GlobalStandardReporting/views/DM-Operations-PickerPerformance-RoosterCompliance/Compliancedashboard&amp;quot;'>https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/#/site/GlobalStandardReporting/views/DM-Operations-PickerPerformance-RoosterCompliance/Compliancedashboard</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>First 10 people, who will switch to the report, will get a chockolate from our team.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10'>For this you need to write to Frederico Arouca, send a screenshot of new report and write a few words, what you find usefull in it and what can be done better.</run>
